            "title": "Synthesis"
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 88-year-old female patient, admitted on 04/01/2021 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. On admission, she presented with fever, dyspnoea, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray and CT confirmed bilateral COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated inflammatory markers. Arterial blood gas analysis indicated hypoxaemic respiratory failure. She was commenced on supplemental oxygen therapy, dexamethasone, and anticoagulation. Antibiotic co-coverage was administered given her age and radiological findings. Physiotherapy and early mobilisation were initiated. Her condition gradually improved with stabilising oxygen requirements. She is discharged in a recovering state with oral medications. Please arrange close follow-up, monitor respiratory function, and ensure she completes the recommended rehabilitation programme. Should her condition deteriorate, prompt reassessment is advised.</div>"
            },
